Stopped counting a required profile field its owner may not write. `plone.autoform` leaves such a field off the edit form, so a profile held for one could never be completed by the person being held: every page they asked for answered with the same form, and the form did not ask for it. A field with no write permission of its own, an owner the site cannot resolve, and a permission whose ZCML never loaded all keep the field required, as before. @ericof
